Local patch 0106 (qwen3.6-35b-a3b-exl3-tensorfold): the 35B adapter's host copies through 0008's Copier.

Why/what: see 0008. qwen3_5_moe/cuda/disk_points.py: attention, head, DeltaNet and held rows go to the host on the
side stream; store.put waits on the copy's event. Prefill with the cache on: 33k 2.7k -> 4.0k tok/s, 8.8k 3.9k -> 4.3k.

